    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests whether a variable can be replaced in a variable name. <p>When {@code enableSubstitutionInVariables} is set to {@code true}, the substitutor resolves inner variables before looking up the outer variable name. For example, {@code ${animal.${species}}} first resolves {@code ${species}} to get a suffix (e.g. \"2\"), then looks up {@code animal.2} in the value map. <p>Also verifies that nested default values ({@code :-}) work correctly when the outer variable is unknown: the default is used as the final result."
   },
